{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1466376-data-of-werewolf-demographics-statistics-and-analyses","id":1466376,"title":"Data of Werewolf: demographics, statistics, and analyses","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-02T19:53:40-07:00","id":1466376,"title":"Data of Werewolf: demographics, statistics, and analyses","content":"For anyone who doesn't already catch my updates elsewhere, I wanted to mention a big one that just happened, in case anyone has been curious about this incredibly nerdy sort of thing: <b>a new section called <a href=\"http://sites.google.com/d/1EjdtL4O53pTzoWvixoBqQEHQeZ3-7mF8/p/1wYOrySaSNLHGZhH82EHVvUnm0aW73HfW/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Data</a> has been added to The Cyber Record!</b><br /> <br /> It features the immense amount of work that <b>SpreadsheetGarou</b> has done collecting data and making statistical analysis on the demographics and representation of statted Werewolf NPCs and template characters, and will one day have my own data that approaches these topics from a different angle. I'm very excited to be able to welcome this honored guest and help give the project the attention it deserves on The Cyber Record.<br /> <br /> Aside of just being an interesting &quot;huh!&quot; to see how Breeds, Auspices, and Tribes are represented outside of their fluff text and in their actual stat sheets, this resource might be very useful for those of you who make your own content, whether casually for your own games, for podcast discussions, or for the Storytellers Vault.<br /> <br /> You can follow SpreadsheetGarou on Twitter (<a href=\"http://twitter.com/ExcelGarou\" target=\"_blank\">@ExcelGarou</a>). They've been going through the current iteration of this data, and then will likely be giving updates about the next iteration as they continue to sift and sort and hone in the statistics.<br /> <br /> <br /> -<br /> <br /> Other than that, I just wanted to mention that I don't check the forums super often anymore and if you want to get ahold of me, the best way to do so is either Discord (The Cyber Record#3718), Gmail (thecyberrecord), or Twitter (<a href=\"https://twitter.com/TheCyberRecord\" target=\"_blank\">@TheCyberRecord</a>). I had a couple forum PMs from people that had been languishing in my inbox for a while before I happened to pop on to see what was being discussed with The Apocalyptic Record KS, so here's how you can get at me to talk about projects like Rage Across Google Maps, glyphs, etc, that will make sure I see them sooner. \ud83d\udc99","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2810-yakecen-sings","name":"Yakecen-Sings","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2810_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-03T12:20:29-07:00","id":1466503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yakecen-Sings</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1466376-data-of-werewolf-demographics-statistics-and-analyses#post1466376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For anyone who doesn't already catch my updates elsewhere, I wanted to mention a big one that just happened, in case anyone has been curious about this incredibly nerdy sort of thing: <b>a new section called <a href=\"https://&amp;quot;http://sites.google.com/d/1EjdtL4O53pTzoWvixoBqQEHQeZ3-7mF8/p/1wYOrySaSNLHGZhH82EHVvUnm0aW73HfW/edit&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">Data</a> has been added to The Cyber Record!</b><br /> <br /> It features the immense amount of work that <b>SpreadsheetGarou</b> has done collecting data and making statistical analysis on the demographics and representation of statted Werewolf NPCs and template characters, and will one day have my own data that approaches these topics from a different angle. I'm very excited to be able to welcome this honored guest and help give the project the attention it deserves on The Cyber Record.<br /> <br /> Aside of just being an interesting &amp;quot;huh!&amp;quot; to see how Breeds, Auspices, and Tribes are represented outside of their fluff text and in their actual stat sheets, this resource might be very useful for those of you who make your own content, whether casually for your own games, for podcast discussions, or for the Storytellers Vault.<br /> <br /> You can follow SpreadsheetGarou on Twitter (<a href=\"https://&amp;quot;http://twitter.com/ExcelGarou&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">@ExcelGarou</a>). They've been going through the current iteration of this data, and then will likely be giving updates about the next iteration as they continue to sift and sort and hone in the statistics.<br /> <br /> <br /> -<br /> <br /> Other than that, I just wanted to mention that I don't check the forums super often anymore and if you want to get ahold of me, the best way to do so is either Discord (The Cyber Record#3718), Gmail (thecyberrecord), or Twitter (<a href=\"https://&amp;quot;https://twitter.com/TheCyberRecord&amp;quot;\" target=\"_blank\">@TheCyberRecord</a>). I had a couple forum PMs from people that had been languishing in my inbox for a while before I happened to pop on to see what was being discussed with The Apocalyptic Record KS, so here's how you can get at me to talk about projects like Rage Across Google Maps, glyphs, etc, that will make sure I see them sooner. \ud83d\udc99</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice to see you again. And again, great work. I do believe that it won't affect the data greatly but I noticed that you didn't mention characters from example of character creation (I think they should be in template category). Ok, two of them (Stuart Brown &quot;Stalks-the-truth&quot; from revised edition and Albrecht from W20) are also in Fianna tribebook and ia. Silver Fangs tribebook but that leaves Walk-no-roads, Lupus, Gaillard Silent Strider from 2nd edition corebook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-03T18:02:42-07:00","id":1466556,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1466376-data-of-werewolf-demographics-statistics-and-analyses?p=1466503#post1466503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do believe that it won't affect the data greatly but I noticed that you didn't mention characters from example of character creation (I think they should be in template category). Ok, two of them (Stuart Brown &quot;Stalks-the-truth&quot; from revised edition and Albrecht from W20) are also in Fianna tribebook and ia. Silver Fangs tribebook but that leaves Walk-no-roads, Lupus, Gaillard Silent Strider from 2nd edition corebook.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am legitimately confused about this reply because the list of characters used for these stats isn't listed in the project; I don't know how anyone reading it would be <i>able</i> to know who was or wasn't included, lol. I think only Zhyzhak was mentioned by name at all, in the course of explaining why one of her stat blocks wasn't included in some of the data. Can you elaborate?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><b