ho was or wasn't included, lol. I think only Zhyzhak was mentioned by name at all, in the course of explaining why one of her stat blocks wasn't included in some of the data. Can you elaborate?</div> </div> </div> </div>Of course. But you mentioned templates as a separate category. All of them are cliaths, ready to play characters. So it's an assuption based on available informations. I also believe that you skipped Ethan Roberts &quot;Gift-of-Claws&quot;, ready to play character template from World of Darkness: Combat. Am I wrong?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":13141,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","user":"Nail Eater","date":". 11-04-2021, 12:24 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-03T22:14:11-07:00","id":1466612,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nail Eater</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1466376-data-of-werewolf-demographics-statistics-and-analyses?p=1466606#post1466606\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Of course. But you mentioned templates as a separate category. All of them are cliaths, ready to play characters. So it's an assuption based on available informations. I also believe that you skipped Ethan Roberts &quot;Gift-of-Claws&quot;, ready to play character template from World of Darkness: Combat. Am I wrong?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, I'm seeing where some of the communication disconnect might be. While I'm working on a project that looks at demographics, mine isn't ready or available yet. The project that is displayed in Data is the work of a separate person, SpreadsheetGarou, not my own. Their data includes any NPC with a their character sheet stats listed, except for the sections that are explicitly analyzing Template characters, to my understanding. I do know for certain that it does include Stalks-the-Truth and two versions of Albrecht. I don't know if it includes the other two mentioned as I haven't seen the latest iteration's raw data, but I will mention the names and their sources to SpreadsheetGarou, in case they don't have them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\"><a href=\"http://thecyberrecord.net\" target=\"_blank\">The Cyber Record</a> is on the </span></b><a href=\"http://geomid.network\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Geomid.Network</span></b></a><br /> <b><span style=\"font-family:verdana\">Activism is Gaian praxis</span></b></div> <div align=\"right\"> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><a href=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" ><img itemprop=\"image\" data-align=\"center\" data-linktype=\"1\" data-linkurl=\"https://www.thecyberrecord.net/quests\" data-size=\"full\" border=\"0\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-thumb-url=\"http://i.imgur.com/iZ3OWzG.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center\" /></a></div><br /> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://fo